    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The list preserves 10 roles in the United States, five roles in Europe and five roles in Africa from the November 16 research snapshot. It prioritizes data analytics, business intelligence, software and data engineering. Employer pages are preferable to aggregators, but an accessible web page does not prove the recruiter is still accepting applicants. Salary is shown only when it was explicitly advertised."
    },
