      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Eligibility before application"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "A role advertised as remote in the United States, France, Spain or South Africa may still require residence and work authorization in that country. Each applicant should check the employer’s current conditions, travel expectations, language requirements and application deadline. This list should be rechecked before publication and marked stale after 14 days without revalidation."
    },
